---
title: Collections
layout: layouts/pagealign.liquid
permalink: /collections/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
eleventyImport:
  collections: ["post"]
---
{%- comment %} The hub. Named "Collections" rather than "Interactions" because
   it covers every post type, not only the four response types — an interactions
   page would be the right name for likes/replies/reposts/bookmarks alone.
{% endcomment -%}
<ul class="collection-list">
{%- for group in collections.postTypes %}
	<li>
		<a href="/{{ group.segment }}/">{{ group.segment | capitalize }}</a>
		<span class="collection-count">{{ group.posts.size }}</span>
	</li>
{%- endfor %}
	<li>
		<a href="/archive/">Archive</a>
		<span class="collection-count">{{ collections.post.size }}</span>
	</li>
</ul>
